<msg n="28" from="eng-69" type="post" channel="#cobalt" mentions="eng-94">@eng-94 gentle nudge: METRICORE-101 is green and waiting on your review. Happy to walk through the inclusive-rank math if useful. Thanks!</msg>
<msg n="29" from="eng-88" type="dm" to="eng-40" mentions="eng-40">Hi @eng-40, I checked my handover notes. For `merge_intervals`, it was agreed in the design review that intervals that only touch (e.g., (0, 10) and (10, 20)) should be merged into one: merge_intervals([(0, 10), (10, 20)]) == [(0, 20)].</msg>
