<msg n="34" from="eng-40" type="dm" to="eng-88" mentions="eng-88">Thanks for the clarification, @eng-88! That's very helpful. It looks like the regression test in the acceptance suite is actually incorrect based on that decision. I'll revert my code change and fix the test instead.</msg>
