<msg n="53" from="eng-92" type="post" channel="#cobalt" mentions="eng-48">@eng-48 Sorry, tried to DM you! Let's definitely keep the pressure on qa-team together. It's not right that we're blocked by contradictory tests. @qa-team, following up on issue #8: we have multiple tickets (METRICORE-113, 114) blocked by incorrect acceptance tests. We need these fixed before the cycle 23 cut to merge. Please prioritize!</msg>
